WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.410
Bus stations.

2
00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:02.570
Airports.

3
00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:04.090
Border crossings.

4
00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:07.450
Every day, people set off for a new life.

5
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:13.690
In 2024, 304 million people lived
outside the country where they were born.

6
00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:17.170
That's 3.7 percent of
the world's population,

7
00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:20.610
up from 2.9 percent in 1990.

8
00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:22.430
Is it money that moves them?

9
00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:23.450
War?

10
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:24.530
Pure chance?

11
00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:28.150
What makes people leave home, and
what decides where they end up?

12
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:32.290
In this mission, you'll map
what pushes people away,

13
00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:36.070
what pulls them elsewhere,
and what stands in between.

14
00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:39.510
Then you'll sort the many
kinds of move people make,

15
00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:42.110
within countries and across borders.

16
00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:45.610
Your mission: find out what
makes people leave home,

17
00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:47.570
and what decides where they end up.
